I was hoping to port [DataForge](https://www.npmjs.com/package/data-forge) to TypeScript, but I've hit a stumbling block. TypeScript doesn't allow circular references between classes in different files the way that it would normally work under Node.js.

For example...

Series.ts
```
import { DataFrame } from './dataframe';

export class Series {

   // various members and functions  

  // Convert Series to a DataFrame.
