````

and consider this case:
now AOF rewrite  is executing,  close aof use "config set appendonly no" ,  in stopAppendOnly function will set server.aof_fd = -1;  
then after the rewrite child process exists, the parent process  execute the backgroundRewriteDoneHandler ,  like this code: 
